   {
    "id": "QA_12170790",
    "required": true,
    "label": "Acme Company is an equal opportunity employer. Company employees and applicants are protected from discrimination based on race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, military service or any other characteristic or status protected by applicable law.  These protections apply to all employment decisions, including, but not limited to, recruitment, hiring, promotions, performance management, and disciplinary issues. The Company provides reasonable accommodation(s) for employees or applicants with disabilities; for pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions; and for religious beliefs and practices. \nPlease enter today’s date to verify your acknowledgment of Acme’s Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) statement.",
